[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4585658466","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119858#issuecomment-4585658466","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119858","id":4585658466,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEVOYYg","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-31T04:03:42Z","updated_at":"2026-05-31T04:13:38Z","body":"After a quick research, maybe CRC32 for `arm64` builds should be dropped. I'm aware certain ARMv8 devices from all the way back in 2013 don't support it.\r\n\r\n*Edit: dropped*","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4585658466/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4587222612","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119858#issuecomment-4587222612","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119858","id":4587222612,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEWt2VA","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-31T15:56:45Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T14:46:02Z","body":"After a little more research, it seems that zlib-ng's compression speed shines more if compression levels are above the default.\r\n\r\nI've repeated the benchmark but with zlib and gzip compression levels set to the maximum value of 9.\r\n\r\n(ms, lower is better):\r\n\r\n#### Compress DEFLATE\r\n|Build|1|2|3|4|\r\n|-|-|-|-|-|\r\n|master|1018.97|956.98|949.50|967.68|\r\n|PR|905.25|905.90|915.67|914.44|\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Compress gzip\r\n|Build|1|2|3|4|\r\n|-|-|-|-|-|\r\n|master|957.76|954.35|970.58|963.05|\r\n|PR|913.17|911.43|907.79|918.17|\r\n\r\nAt maximum level, compression with zlib-ng can be 5-7% faster than base zlib.\r\n\r\nDidn't include decompression time as the level doesn't weight much.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4587222612/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754233533","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119858#issuecomment-4754233533","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119858","id":4754233533,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG1_YvQ","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T19:33:39Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T23:50:13Z","body":"## TPS Demo import\r\n\r\nTest importing the [TPS Demo](https://github.com/godotengine/tps-demo) using the editor.\r\n\r\nCommand: `godot_editor.x86_64 --headless --import`\r\n\r\nEach run had its `.godot/` directory deleted.\r\n\r\n(ms, lower is better):\r\n\r\n|Build|1|2|3|4|\r\n|-|-|-|-|-|\r\n|master|19500|19499|19512|19506|\r\n|PR|18484|18499|18501|18506|\r\n\r\nIn average, importing should be **1.0544x faster**.\r\n\r\n## TPS Demo export\r\n\r\nCommand: `godot_editor.x86_64 --headless --export-pack Linux pack.pck/zip`\r\n\r\n### PCK\r\n|Build|1|2|3|4|5|6|\r\n|-|-|-|-|-|-|-|\r\n|master|3334|3328|3348|3309|3318|3360|\r\n|PR|3313|3322|3300|3305|3309|3315|\r\n\r\nExporting with zlib-ng is, in average, 1.0067x faster than the default zlib.\r\n\r\n### ZIP\r\n|Build|1|2|3|4|\r\n|-|-|-|-|-|\r\n|master|15955|16321|16324|16322|\r\n|PR|8557|9336|9356|9309|\r\n\r\nI did less tests for this one because the difference in time was massive enough (over 1.77x faster) to need to contain fluctuation. On the other hand, the resulting ZIP file in the PR scenario was around 0.7% bigger in size, which is to be expected since even zlib itself doesn't guarantee the compressed data will be the same between versions.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754233533/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]